    notebook view (as a <code>.cell-notes</code> cell). Markdown goes through
    <code>markdown</code> + <code>bleach</code> with an allowlist tuned for research
    notes — tables, fenced code, footnotes, links allowed; script/style/iframe/inline
    handlers stripped. Bare URLs auto-linkify.
